WEBVTT

01:02:58.812 --> 01:03:02.653
So ultimately, when all
the transitions are done,

01:03:02.677 --> 01:03:04.911
people will no longer
have to do routine jobs.

01:03:04.935 --> 01:03:07.736
And that is a huge gift to humanity.

01:03:07.760 --> 01:03:11.642
So that people can think more
about what they love to do,

01:03:11.666 --> 01:03:13.117
what they're good at doing,

01:03:13.141 --> 01:03:16.664
and why it is that people exist,

01:03:16.688 --> 01:03:18.196
the meaning of life,

01:03:18.220 --> 01:03:21.776
and pursue their hobbies
and spend time with their loved ones.

01:03:21.800 --> 01:03:25.561
So it is really a liberation
at the end of the day,

01:03:25.585 --> 01:03:27.918
but we just have to get through
the challenges

01:03:27.942 --> 01:03:30.513
that are in the next 15 or 20 years.